        "text": "<thinking> To implement the fetch_recent_logs.py file that retrieves recent log results filtered by field values and time range, I need to choose a concrete external provider. I'll use the AWS CloudWatch Logs service for this task, as it is a well-known managed logging service that allows querying logs with specific filters and time ranges. I will import the boto3 library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, to interact with CloudWatch Logs. The boto3 library and the specific client for CloudWatch Logs will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
