        "text": "<thinking> To implement the `query_error_logs.py` script that queries recent error log entries filtered by severity and time range, I will use the Datadog Log Management service as the concrete external provider. Datadog is a popular service for log management and provides an API for querying logs. I will import the Datadog SDK and use it to query logs based on the specified filters. </thinking>\n",
