        "text": "<thinking> To create the file write_correlated_logs.py that writes application log events with a shared request or correlation identifier, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider. I will use the Amazon CloudWatch Logs service for this task, as it is a managed logging service that allows for the ingestion and querying of log data. I will import the boto3 library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, to interact with the CloudWatch Logs API. The boto3 library and the specific client for CloudWatch Logs will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
